\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces AMT-UNet architecture. The model consists of a CNN encoder-decoder with residual blocks and instance normalization, an adaptive masked transformer bottleneck for global context modeling with soft masking, CBAM-enhanced skip connections, multi-scale feature fusion, and dual outputs for segmentation (3 classes) and ROI-guided classification (2 classes). Deep supervision is applied at three decoder scales.}}{14}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{14}{AMT-UNet architecture. The model consists of a CNN encoder-decoder with residual blocks and instance normalization, an adaptive masked transformer bottleneck for global context modeling with soft masking, CBAM-enhanced skip connections, multi-scale feature fusion, and dual outputs for segmentation (3 classes) and ROI-guided classification (2 classes). Deep supervision is applied at three decoder scales}{figure.1}{}}
